flowchart TD
subgraph "Client Layer (Frontend)"
Mobile[📱 Mobile App\nReact Native / Android]
Web[💻 Web App\nReact / Next.js - Futuro]
end

subgraph "API Gateway / Auth (Futuro)"
Gateway[🛡️ API Gateway & JWT Auth]
end

subgraph "Backend Services (Microservices / Modular Monolith)"
Core[⚙️ KorusCore Orchestrator\nKotlin + Spring Boot]
Worker[🤖 OCR-Worker\nRust]
end

subgraph "Infrastructure Layer"
DB[(🗄️ PostgreSQL\nkorus_db)]
Broker[🐰 RabbitMQ\nMessage Queue]
Storage[📂 Shared Storage\nVolume / S3]
end

Mobile -->|REST / HTTPS| Gateway
Web -->|REST / HTTPS| Gateway

Gateway -->|Rutea petición + Inyecta X-User-Id| Core

Core -->|1. CRUD Users, Wallets, Tx| DB
Core -->|2. Sube Ticket de gasto| Storage
Core -->|3. Publica evento 'Nuevo Ticket'| Broker

Broker -->|4. Consume evento| Worker
Worker -->|5. Lee imagen| Storage
Worker -->|6. Actualiza metadata OCR| DB